message: "If you use this research repository, cite the repository and the relevant external technical sources."
title: "Vision Only Leader Follower Warehouse Coordination"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kanchani
    given-names: Neeraj Kumar
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-09-18
repository-code: "https://github.com/justneeraj12/ee616-vision-leader-follower"
url: "https://github.com/justneeraj12/ee616-vision-leader-follower"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research code, evidence, and faculty-review material for a
  camera-only predecessor-following warehouse material-delivery convoy. The
  current implementation is a deterministic two-dimensional kinematic toy
  baseline and is not ROS 2, Gazebo, physical-robot, or production-safety
  evidence.
keywords:
  - leader follower robotics
  - computer vision
  - state estimation
  - formation control
  - ROS 2
  - Gazebo
  - warehouse robotics
